---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Proposal · CrinklePak · Rivett';
const description = 'Strategic Audit + Outreach Engine proposal for Mark Gannon, CrinklePak. Per our chat today.';
---
<Base
  title={title}
  description={description}
  fontWeights="Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600;700;800"
>
<div class="proposal">

  <div class="system-banner">
    <span><b>Rivett</b> · Proposal</span>
    <span>For <b>Mark Gannon</b> · CrinklePak · <b>v1</b></span>
  </div>

  <div class="page">

    <div class="phead">
      <a class="wm" href="/"><span>rivett</span><span class="dot"></span></a>
      <div class="ref">
        <span>From · <b>Fred Style</b></span>
        <span>To · <b>Mark Gannon</b></span>
        <span>Re · <b>The Crinkler Engine</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="stamp">Proposal · post-call follow-up</span>
      <h1>Remember how I found you? <span class="ital">Let's do that for your buyers.</span></h1>
      <p class="dek">Mark - good chat. You said "I don't know" a few times. Perfect. The job is to take that off your plate. Here's the shape of it.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- 01 RECAP -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="lbl">Recap<span class="num">01</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>What's actually happening at CrinklePak. <span class="ital">In plain English.</span></h2>
        <p class="lede">You're running a real business with real product, real ad spend, and real wholesale buyers. What's missing isn't tactics. It's a system that hunts your buyers and tracks every step of it.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>You're spending on <b>Google + LinkedIn ads</b> but flying blind on what happens after the click.</li>
          <li>You're <b>missing retargeting tags</b> on Meta, Pinterest, Google - so your ad dollars evaporate instead of compounding.</li>
          <li>Your site reads generic. The product is premium. <b>The storefront isn't keeping up.</b></li>
          <li>There's a <b>B2B blind spot</b> - LinkedIn ads bring wholesale buyers to your site but you can't see which companies are browsing.</li>
          <li>You're <b>sitting on inbound</b>. Bulk orders should be coming to you, not the other way around.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PULL QUOTE -->
    <div class="page pull">
      <blockquote>
        "I don't know" is the most honest thing an operator can say. <span style="font-family:var(--grotesk); font-style:normal; color:var(--ink-dim);">- and it's the exact moment to bring in someone who does.</span>
      </blockquote>
      <cite>Mark · Chief Crinkler · today</cite>
    </div>

    <!-- 02 THE ENGINE -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="lbl">The Engine<span class="num">02</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>The Crinkler Engine. <span class="ital">The product, in one move.</span></h2>
        <p class="lede">Remember how I found you? Personalised audit, sent at the right moment, called out the exact thing you'd been ignoring. You took the call. That experience is the product. I want to run it on every wholesale buyer in your market.</p>

        <div class="numbox">
          <div><span class="k">Setup</span><span class="v">$5,000 <span class="ital">one-time</span></span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Monthly</span><span class="v">$6,000/mo</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Volume</span><span class="v">~50 prospects/wk</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Commitment</span><span class="v">Cancel any month</span></div>
        </div>

        <h3>What the engine does</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>ICP mining.</b> Every gift basket brand, subscription box, 3PL, and e-com shop in the US that ships enough volume to need pallet-grade fill. Names, contacts, decision-makers.</li>
          <li><b>Custom audit per prospect.</b> Same engine I used on CrinklePak, pointed at <em>them</em>. Auto-generated, personalised, posted at their own domain (rivett.tech/audit/v3/[their-brand]). Demonstrates value before asking for anything.</li>
          <li><b>Multi-touch outbound.</b> LinkedIn DM + email + follow-up sequence. Personalised, on-brand for CrinklePak ("Chief Crinkler" energy). Booked meetings drop into your calendar.</li>
          <li><b>Live dashboard.</b> Reply rate, meetings booked, pipeline dollars, ROI vs current ad spend. You can audit your auditor at any time.</li>
          <li><b>Pipeline + attribution.</b> Every prospect tagged. Every reply tracked. Every closed deal sourced. No more guessing what's working.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>What it replaces</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Hiring a wholesale BD person at <b>$90-120k/yr all-in</b>.</li>
          <li>Spending more on LinkedIn ads without fixing the conversion gap.</li>
          <li>The "wait and hope" status quo that's capping CrinklePak's growth.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Total Year 1: <b>$77,000</b> all-in. Same money as one BD hire. None of the overhead. Cancel any month.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 THE DOORWAY -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="lbl">The Doorway<span class="num">03</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>The Strategic Audit. <span class="ital">$3,500. Two weeks. Prove it on you first.</span></h2>
        <p class="lede">Before we point the engine at your buyers, we point it at you. Two weeks. Written plan. Yours to keep. Same methodology, applied to CrinklePak's own pipeline - so you can see exactly what the engine produces before you sign for the bigger thing.</p>

        <div class="numbox">
          <div><span class="k">Investment</span><span class="v">$3,500</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Timeline</span><span class="v">2 weeks</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Deliverable</span><span class="v">Written plan</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Walkthrough</span><span class="v">30 min <span class="ital">included</span></span></div>
        </div>

        <h3>What you get</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Full diagnosis</b> using your real data - Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, Shopify, GA4, your email setup.</li>
          <li><b>Plain-English leak list</b> - what's broken, what it's costing you, what the fix is.</li>
          <li><b>Hero rewrite</b> for your homepage - the one I previewed on the call, fully drafted.</li>
          <li><b>Engine simulation</b> - a sample of 10 wholesale prospects, scored by ICP fit, with the audits I'd send them and the DM I'd open with.</li>
          <li><b>Quick-wins list</b> - things you (or your guy) can ship this week, no Rivett required.</li>
          <li><b>30-min walkthrough call</b> when delivered. We go through it line by line.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>You walk away with a plan. <b>Yours forever.</b> Run it yourself, hand it to your guy, hire me to fire up the engine. Entirely your call.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 WHY -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="lbl">Why<span class="num">04</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Why this is the easy yes.</h2>

        <div class="why">
          <div class="w">
            <span class="stamp">No tech</span>
            <h5>You don't need to know any of this. <span class="ital">That's my job.</span></h5>
            <p>You said it on the call: "I don't know." Perfect. Built for operators who'd rather run the business than figure out the marketing stack.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w">
            <span class="stamp">Stay in control</span>
            <h5>One fixed price to start. <span class="ital">No subscriptions hidden.</span></h5>
            <p>$3,500 for the audit. Decide on the engine after. If the audit doesn't blow you away, you walk with the plan and the hero rewrite for less than a month of one Google Ads campaign.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w">
            <span class="stamp">Proof first</span>
            <h5>The audit IS the demo. <span class="ital">Of the engine.</span></h5>
            <p>You experienced the cold-outreach methodology first-hand. The audit shows you exactly what it looks like at scale - on your terms, for your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- END-CTA -->
    <section class="end-cta">
      <div class="left">
        <span class="stamp stamp--on-ink">How to start</span>
        <h3>Reply "let's do it." <span class="ital">SOW + invoice goes out today.</span></h3>
        <p>Two weeks from kickoff to written plan. The next move is yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <span class="n">01</span>
            <p><b>Reply</b> "let's do it" - or any variant. SOW + invoice today.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="n">02</span>
            <p><b>Pay 50%</b> to kick off ($1,750). Final 50% on delivery.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="n">03</span>
            <p><b>Book the kickoff</b> - <a href="https://cal.com/fred-style/discovery">cal.com/fred-style/discovery</a>. 30 min, we align on data access.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="n">04</span>
            <p><b>Two weeks later</b> - written plan in your inbox, walkthrough on the calendar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="sign">
      Everyday I'm Crinkling, Mark. Let's get the engine fired up.
      <span class="name">Fred</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pfoot">
      <a class="wm wm--sm" href="/"><span>rivett</span><span class="dot"></span></a>
      <span>Proposal · v1 · <b>$3,500 doorway · $77k Y1 engine</b></span>
      <span>fred@rivett.tech</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
.proposal {
  background: var(--paper);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.proposal .page {
  max-width: 920px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 48px;
}
@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .proposal .page { padding: 0 24px; }
}

.proposal .system-banner {
  background: var(--paper-2);
  padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-6);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sp-4);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  border-bottom: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line);
}
.proposal .system-banner b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

.proposal .phead {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: var(--sp-7) 0;
  border-bottom: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sp-4);
}
.proposal .wm {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.1em;
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 28px;
  letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.proposal .wm .dot {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 0.32em;
  height: 0.32em;
  background: var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
  transform: translateY(0.04em);
}
.proposal .wm--sm { font-size: 14px; }
.proposal .ref {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--sp-6);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.proposal .ref b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

.proposal .stamp {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent-deep);
}
.proposal .stamp::before {
  content: '';
  display: inline-block;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  background: var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
  margin-right: 12px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.proposal .stamp--on-ink { color: var(--on-ink-faint); }
.proposal .stamp--on-ink::before { background: var(--accent); }

.proposal .hero {
  padding: var(--sp-14) 0 var(--sp-10);
  border-bottom: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line-strong);
}
.proposal .hero .stamp { margin-bottom: var(--sp-4); }
.proposal .hero h1 {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(40px, 5.6vw, 64px);
  line-height: 0.98;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-display);
  margin: var(--sp-3) 0 0;
  text-wrap: balance;
  max-width: 880px;
}
.proposal .hero h1 .ital {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.proposal .hero .dek {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: clamp(19px, 2vw, 24px);
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
  margin: var(--sp-7) 0 0;
  max-width: 720px;
}

.proposal .sec {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  border-top: var(--bw-rule) solid var(--ink);
  padding: var(--sp-12) 0 var(--sp-10);
}
@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .proposal .sec { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--sp-5); padding-top: var(--sp-8); }
}
.proposal .sec .lbl {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  align-self: start;
}
.proposal .sec .lbl .num {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 48px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-top: var(--sp-2);
  letter-spacing: var(--track-tighter);
}
.proposal .sec .body { min-width: 0; }
.proposal .sec h2 {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 36px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-h);
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
  text-wrap: balance;
}
.proposal .sec h2 .ital {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
}
.proposal .sec h3 {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 17px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-h-sm);
  margin: var(--sp-8) 0 var(--sp-3);
  color: var(--ink);
}
.proposal .sec p {
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: var(--sp-3) 0;
  max-width: 640px;
}
.proposal .sec p.lede {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 21px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-6);
}
.proposal .sec ul {
  margin: var(--sp-3) 0;
  padding-left: 0;
  list-style: none;
  max-width: 680px;
}
.proposal .sec ul li {
  padding: var(--sp-3) 0 var(--sp-3) 28px;
  border-bottom: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line);
  position: relative;
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.proposal .sec ul li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.proposal .sec ul li::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 20px;
  width: 14px;
  height: var(--bw-rule);
  background: var(--accent-deep);
}
.proposal .sec ul li b { font-weight: 600; }
.proposal .sec ul li em {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
}

.proposal .numbox {
  background: var(--sage);
  padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-7);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: var(--sp-6);
  border-left: var(--bw-thick) solid var(--accent-deep);
  margin: var(--sp-5) 0 var(--sp-7);
}
@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .proposal .numbox { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
.proposal .numbox .k {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent-deep);
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.proposal .numbox .v {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-tighter);
  color: var(--ink);
}
.proposal .numbox .v .ital {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
  font-size: 0.85em;
}

.proposal .pull {
  padding: var(--sp-10) 0;
  border-top: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--ink);
  border-bottom: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--ink);
  margin: var(--sp-8) 0;
}
.proposal .pull blockquote {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
  line-height: 1.22;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-wrap: balance;
  max-width: 800px;
}
.proposal .pull cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: var(--sp-4);
  font-style: normal;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.proposal .why {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  border: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line);
  margin: var(--sp-5) 0;
}
@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .proposal .why { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
.proposal .why .w {
  padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-6);
  border-right: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line);
}
.proposal .why .w:last-child { border-right: 0; }
@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .proposal .why .w { border-right: 0; border-bottom: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line); }
  .proposal .why .w:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
}
.proposal .why .w h5 {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-h-sm);
  margin: var(--sp-2) 0 var(--sp-2);
  color: var(--ink);
  text-wrap: balance;
}
.proposal .why .w h5 .ital {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
}
.proposal .why .w p {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
  margin: 0;
}

.proposal .end-cta {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--on-ink);
  padding: var(--sp-14) var(--sp-12);
  margin: var(--sp-14) 0 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}
@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .proposal .end-cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--sp-7); padding: var(--sp-10); }
}
.proposal .end-cta .stamp { color: var(--on-ink-faint); margin-bottom: var(--sp-5); }
.proposal .end-cta .stamp::before { background: var(--accent); }
.proposal .end-cta h3 {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px);
  line-height: 1.04;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-h);
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
  color: var(--on-ink);
  text-wrap: balance;
}
.proposal .end-cta h3 .ital {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--on-ink-italic);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.proposal .end-cta p {
  color: var(--on-ink-dim);
  margin: var(--sp-3) 0;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.proposal .end-cta .steps {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sp-4);
}
.proposal .end-cta .step {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr;
  gap: var(--sp-3);
  align-items: start;
}
.proposal .end-cta .step .n {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 24px;
  color: var(--accent);
  line-height: 1;
  padding-top: 2px;
}
.proposal .end-cta .step p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--on-ink-dim);
}
.proposal .end-cta .step p b { color: var(--on-ink); font-weight: 600; }
.proposal .end-cta .step a {
  color: var(--accent);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
}

.proposal .sign {
  margin: var(--sp-14) 0 var(--sp-10);
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--ink-dim);
}
.proposal .sign .name {
  font-family: var(--grotesk);
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
  display: block;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.proposal .pfoot {
  padding: var(--sp-7) 0 var(--sp-10);
  border-top: var(--bw-hair) solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sp-3);
}
.proposal .pfoot b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
</style>
</Base>
